{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29829","headline":"寄和水部马郎中题兴德驿时昭义已平 · 李商隐","name":"寄和水部马郎中题兴德驿时昭义已平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎倦去心，郑驿暂登临。\n水色潇湘阔，沙程朔漠深。\n鷁舟时往复，鸥鸟恣浮沈。\n更想逢归马，悠悠岳树阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}